{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_01CKYC9P8JX1FNnyNUmjvBVt","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"All work is complete and committed. Final status:\n\n## Summary\n\nAll ten SOS cards plus the three shared engine changes are implemented, tested through the real engine, and committed (one commit per item). Working tree is clean.\n\n**Test results:** 1244 passed (1145 engine guard + 60 SOS + 39 FDN), zero regressions. Each card was also verified with an independent throwaway smoke check distinct from its written tests.\n\n### Shared engine changes (E1–E3, additive only)\n- **E1** — fire `SpellCastTriggeredEvent` in `cast_spell`.\n- **E2** — added/fired `BeginningOfPrecombatMainTriggeredEvent` from `GameState.advance_phase` (after `empty_mana_pools`).\n- **E3** — battlefield cost-reduction aggregation (`spell_cost_reduction` hook) in `get_cost_reduction`.\n\n### The ten cards\n| Card | Key mechanics | Notable engine work |\n|---|---|---|\n| sos_4 Together as One | Converge (`colors_spent`) | none |\n| sos_1 Dawning Archaic | cost-reduction, free-cast, exile-instead | fired `AttacksTriggeredEvent` (was dead; also fixes fdn_194) |\n| sos_245 Witherbloom | affinity self + grant via E3 | none |\n| sos_226 Silverquill | casualty copy via E1 | none |\n| sos_257 Great Hall | restricted mana, land animation, pump | restricted-mana in `ManaPool`+`cast_spell`; fired `EndStepTriggeredEvent` (also fixes fdn_81) |\n| sos_57 Mana Sculpt | counter + delayed mana via E2 | `card.mana_spent` field |\n| sos_120 Improvisation Capstone | cast-from-exile + Paradigm copy | none |\n| sos_13 Emeritus // Swords | token, prepared, prepare-spell copy | none |\n| sos_201 Lorehold | miracle + loot | none |\n| sos_97 Ral Zarek | surveil / reanimate / coin-flip / skip-turns | `GameState._skip_turns` in `advance_phase`; lazy `game.rng` |\n\nAll engine edits were additive (no renames/moves/deletes), each justified by a real card need and kept card-local where the mechanic serves one card. Deliberate decisions and limitations are logged in `KEY_DECISIONS.md` — notably the one spec-grounded deviation from the plan: per rulebook 722.3c, sos_13's prepared copy is cast paying its `{W}` cost rather than free."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":735,"cache_read_input_tokens":318743,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":735},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"923ba1d4-5eb7-4630-af94-5c3297d81947","uuid":"e543f34e-1af4-4f6d-b0d3-71c3cc12e9b6","request_id":"req_011CbtWfrB5XscjewsgQjaxs"}
